      "I think there may be a small mistake there!\n",
      "\n",
      "The correct name is Donald Trump, not \"donal\" Trump.\n",
      "\n",
      "Donald Trump is the 45th and current President of the United States, serving from 2017 to 2021. He is a businessman, real estate developer, and television personality who became famous for his wealth, business ventures, and reality TV show \"The Apprentice.\"\n",
      "\n",
      "Born on June 14, 1946, in Queens, New York, Trump built his business empire through a series of successful real estate deals, hotels, and casinos. He became a well-known figure in the 2000s due to his reality TV show \"The Apprentice,\" where he served as the host and executive producer.\n",
      "\n",
      "In 2016, Trump was elected as the President of the United States, defeating Hillary Clinton in the presidential election. His presidency was marked by controversy, including his stance on immigration, trade, and environmental issues, as well as several high-profile scandals and controversies.\n",
      "\n",
      "After completing his first term, Trump lost the 2020 presidential election to Joe Biden and was succeeded as President by Biden on January 20, 2021.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "query='Who is donal trump? '\n",
    "response =llm.invoke(query)\n",
